Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Revise the whimsy layer: word hover, eye-tracking mascot,
 scroll danfo; remove doodles and custom cursor

PART 1 removals (code deleted, not hidden):
- custom wand cursor and sparkle trail, every cursor:none, and the
  cursor-follower element/effect; the browser default cursor is restored
- the Sign-in oval/ring and spinning-coin loader
- every fruit, food, coin and vehicle doodle (mango, jollof, suya, puff
  puff, zobo, coin, danfo/bus/car) from the margins, hero, Play overlay,
  footer skyline, loader and 404; the doodle library now only has trophy,
  crown, medal and clock
- the old straight-line danfo runner/road, the hover-tilt margin system,
  and the hero oval orbit

PART 3:
- the home headline is split into accessible word spans; a MutationObserver
  enhancer wraps every other page's main h1 into word spans (aria-label on
  the heading, aria-hidden spans)
- each word lifts/tilts/bounces with per-word colour and drawn underline;
  tiny sparkles pop; tap works on touch; no layout shift

PART 4:
- one Naija vibes mascot on every page: big tracking pupils, random blinking,
  eyebrows that lift when the pointer is near, bob, speech bubble on hover,
  wiggle on click, self-directed eyes on touch, reduced-motion safe

PART 5:
- one scroll-driven yellow/black-striped danfo in the side margin on a wavy
  path; idle bounce and spinning wheels; faces direction; tiny star puffs;
  25% opacity over text; low z-index behind content; parked under reduced
  motion

Kept: stars, tournament trophy/clock, leaderboard medals, footer skyline,
hero underline, reveals, microcopy, card hover and click sparkles/shouts.
Verified every route in light mode (0 overflow, 0 blocked controls), mobile,
dark and reduced-motion.
